{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06546","headline":"至岳寺即大通大照禅塔上温上人 · 储光羲","name":"至岳寺即大通大照禅塔上温上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋山下暎宫，宫色宜朝阳。\n迢递在半岭，参差非一行。\n燕息云满门，出游花隐房。\n二尊此成道，禅宇遥相望。\n凤铎天中鸣，岩梯松下长。\n山墟响信鼓，蘅薄生蕙香。\n起灭一以雪，往来亦诚亡。\n悲哉门弟子，要自知心长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}